#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: basketball-scorebook.php
#: basketball-scorebook.php:256
#: basketball-scorebook.php:311
msgid "Basketball Scorebook"
msgstr "Basketball Scorebook"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: basketball-scorebook.php
msgid "https://doc778.com/scorebook/"
msgstr "https://doc778.com/scorebook/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: basketball-scorebook.php
msgid "Free digital basketball scorebook for games. Features timestamps, LocalStorage saving, and PDF printing support."
msgstr "試合で使える無料のバスケットボールデジタルスコアシート。タイムスタンプ付き、LocalStorage保存、PDF印刷対応。"

#. Author of the plugin
#: basketball-scorebook.php
msgid "ofbita"
msgstr "ofbita"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: basketball-scorebook.php
msgid "https://doc778.com/"
msgstr "https://doc778.com/"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:262
msgid "📱 Recommended Environment:"
msgstr "📱 推奨環境:"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:263
msgid "We recommend using landscape mode on iPad or PC with Safari / Chrome (LINE in-app browser is not recommended)."
msgstr "iPad または PC の横向き、Safari / Chrome でのご利用を推奨します(LINE 内ブラウザは非推奨)。"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:265
msgid "💾 Data Storage:"
msgstr "💾 データ保存:"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:266
msgid "Your input is automatically saved to browser LocalStorage. Data will be restored when you revisit using the same device and browser."
msgstr "入力内容はブラウザの LocalStorage に自動保存されます。同じ端末・ブラウザであれば再訪時に復元されます。"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:268
msgid "🖨️ Print / PDF:"
msgstr "🖨️ 印刷 / PDF:"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:269
msgid "You can print or save as PDF in A4 landscape format from the \"Print / PDF\" button in the app."
msgstr "アプリ内の「印刷 / PDF」ボタンから、スコアシートのみを A4 横で印刷 / PDF 保存できます。"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:310
msgid "Basketball Scorebook Settings"
msgstr "Basketball Scorebook 設定"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:352
msgid "Basketball Scorebook - Settings and Usage"
msgstr "Basketball Scorebook - 設定と使い方"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:355
msgid "Privacy / Data Storage"
msgstr "プライバシー / データ保存"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:356
msgid "Your scorebook data is saved in your browser (LocalStorage). It is not saved to the WordPress database."
msgstr "スコアブックのデータはブラウザ（LocalStorage）に保存されます。WordPress のデータベースには保存されません。"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:357
msgid "For important games, we recommend exporting JSON as a backup."
msgstr "重要な試合では、バックアップとして JSON のエクスポートをおすすめします。"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:364
msgid "Anonymous Usage Statistics (Opt-in)"
msgstr "匿名利用統計（任意）"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:369
msgid "Send anonymous usage events to help improve this plugin (default: OFF)."
msgstr "このプラグインの改善のため、匿名の利用イベントを送信する（デフォルト: OFF）。"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:372
msgid "We only send minimal event data (plugin version, WP/PHP version, locale, and event name). We do not send your site URL, email address, or any scorebook contents."
msgstr "送信するのは最小限のイベントデータ（プラグインのバージョン、WP/PHP のバージョン、ロケール、イベント名）のみです。サイトの URL、メールアドレス、スコアブックの内容は送信しません。"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:374
msgid "Save Changes"
msgstr "変更を保存"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:378
msgid "Please add the following shortcode to any post or page. We recommend using the widest page template (full-width, etc.) for the best experience."
msgstr "以下のショートコードを投稿または固定ページに貼り付けてご利用ください。最も広いページテンプレート(全幅など)でご利用いただくことを推奨します。"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:382
#: basketball-scorebook.php:445
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "コピー"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:389
msgid "Thanks for using Basketball Scorebook!"
msgstr "Basketball Scorebook をご利用いただきありがとうございます！"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:390
msgid "If you find it helpful, a review would really support ongoing development."
msgstr "お役に立てていれば、レビューをいただけると今後の開発の励みになります。"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:422
msgid "Leave a Review"
msgstr "レビューを書く"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:425
msgid "View Help"
msgstr "ヘルプを見る"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:428
msgid "Not Now"
msgstr "後で"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:434
msgid "Height Customization"
msgstr "高さのカスタマイズ"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:436
msgid "To customize the iframe height, specify the "
msgstr "iframeの高さをカスタマイズしたい場合は、"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:438
msgid "attribute. The default is "
msgstr "属性を指定できます。デフォルトは"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:440
msgid "(85% of viewport height)."
msgstr "(ビューポートの高さの85%)です。"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:449
msgid "Usage Examples:"
msgstr "使用例:"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:450
msgid "Full screen height"
msgstr "画面全体の高さ"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:451
msgid "Fixed 600 pixels"
msgstr "固定の600ピクセル"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:452
msgid "90% of screen height"
msgstr "画面の90%の高さ"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:455
msgid "Usage & Demo Site"
msgstr "使い方・デモサイト"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:456
msgid "For detailed usage instructions, examples, and the latest information, please visit the developer's website. It also serves as a full-featured demo of this plugin."
msgstr "具体的な利用方法、応用例、最新の情報は、開発元サイトでご確認いただけます。本プラグインの全機能のデモも兼ねています。"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:460
msgid "【Official】Basketball Scorebook Usage Guide & Demo Site"
msgstr "【公式】Basketball Scorebook 利用ガイド・デモサイトはこちら"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:464
msgid "Support Notice"
msgstr "サポートに関する注意点"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:466
msgid "This plugin is provided under the GPL license, but "
msgstr "本プラグインはGPLライセンスで提供されますが、"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:467
msgid "if you remove or modify the developer links or copyright notices in the code, that version will be considered unofficial and will not be eligible for support or bug fixes"
msgstr "コード内の開発元へのリンクや著作権表示を削除・改変した場合、そのバージョンは非公式なものとみなし、サポートおよびバグ修正の対象外"

#: basketball-scorebook.php:468
msgid ". Thank you for your understanding."
msgstr "とさせていただきます。ご理解をお願いいたします。"
